public import Theory.SpecificGroups.MacWilliams.UnitaryQuadraticCoordinates

/-!
# Candidate frames for the balanced binary quadratic normal form

Each row stores a packed coefficient tuple, four source vectors, and two central
vectors, in little-endian binary coordinates. These 2,016 rows were discovered
by changing bases in the unitary quadratic form. This module contains data only;
coverage and soundness are separate proof obligations. The source of the normal
form is MacWilliams, Trans. AMS 150 (1970), DOI 10.1090/S0002-9947-1970-0276324-3.
-/

